<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 7.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Oct 7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grafton 87,000 long tons light grains Mississippi/Holland 6-15/11 $9.75 12 days shex ADM.</p>
<p>Albion II 25,000 long tons grain Durban/Buenaventura 12/10 $18.00 4,000/2,000 Andre.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
